# Netscape HTTP Cookie File
# Copy this file to jar.txt (same directory) if you need authenticated Bilibili access.
#
# How to use:
#   1. Copy:  copy jar.txt.example jar.txt   (Windows)  or  cp jar.txt.example jar.txt
#   2. Export cookies from your browser for bilibili.com (e.g. "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY" extension)
#      and paste them below, OR leave empty — scripts can auto-bootstrap anonymous buvid cookies.
#   3. Never commit jar.txt (it is listed in .gitignore).
#
# Format (tab-separated):
# domain  flag  path  secure  expiration  name  value
#
# Example line (replace with real values from your browser export):
# .bilibili.com	TRUE	/	FALSE	1893456000	SESSDATA	your_sessdata_here
